; Actual344: the admitted original init parent can read status but getpidcon
; is denied for these two short-lived original RC services. Original ps -AZ
; supplies persistent-service SIDs, but runs after these oneshots have exited.
; Permit only their kernel process-context metadata to the original parent.
; Configured seclabels, successful exits and pre-exec init SIDs are not witnesses.
; No Linux observer widening, ptrace, signal, transition, capability, file write,
; Binder access or runtime authorization is introduced by these two edges.
(allow init aconfigd (process (getattr)))
(allow init aconfigd_mainline (process (getattr)))
